## The fountain menu
super_enchantments.fountain.title=Super Enchantment Fountain
super_enchantments.fountain.body=The waters hum with power. Every enchantment goes up to level %s here.\n\nYou carry §9%s§r lapis lazuli. Each level costs §9%s§r lapis.
super_enchantments.fountain.button.new=%s
super_enchantments.fountain.button.upgrade=%s §7(now %s)
super_enchantments.fountain.level=Level
super_enchantments.fountain.cost=Each level above the current one costs %s lapis lazuli. You carry %s.
super_enchantments.fountain.submit=Enchant
super_enchantments.fountain.hold=Hold the item you want to enchant, then use the fountain.
super_enchantments.fountain.nothing=The fountain has nothing to offer that item.
super_enchantments.fountain.book=The fountain enchants gear directly, not books.
super_enchantments.fountain.maxed=%s is already at level %s, the most the fountain can give.
super_enchantments.fountain.changed=You switched items. Hold the item you chose and try again.
super_enchantments.fountain.lapis=That needs §9%s§r lapis lazuli and you carry §9%s§r.
super_enchantments.fountain.failed=The fountain could not put %s on that item.
super_enchantments.fountain.done=The fountain grants §d%s %s§r to your %s for %s lapis.

